# Never commit firmware dumps, patched images or backups (Valve's firmware, not ours to redistribute).
# Collector archives and boot-ROM dumps also contain Deck/board serial numbers, device IDs and per-unit factory data.
*.bin
*.hex
*.srec
*.s19
*.mot
*.dump
*.bak
*.tar.gz
rom-dump.json
manifest.json
# Unpacked collector archives (same name as the archive, without .tar.gz)
steamdeck-controller-*/
# Jingle audio / sample data (may be third-party material)
*.s8
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
